<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;HIGHER PRICED MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Higher Priced Mortgage Loans (HPML) are consumer-purpose loans secured by a principal dwelling with an APR higher than specified benchmarks."</data>
