</node>
<node id="&quot;FHA STREAMLINE REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Streamline Refinance is a government-backed refinance option that allows borrowers to refinance loans with minimal lender requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 17}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA INTEREST RATE REDUCTION REFINANCE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"VA Interest Rate Reduction Refinance Loan (IRRRL) is a product allowing veterans to refinance existing loans at lower interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 18}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECOND MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Second Mortgage loans are loans secured against a property that already has a mortgage, typically used for additional funding needs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 17}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCTOBER 1, 2009&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
