  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Policies and Procedures detail the guidelines and rules governing the processing and approval of Higher Priced Mortgage Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Policies and Procedures outlines the regulations and guidelines for loan assessment in mortgage lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Policies and Procedures refers to the formal directives for practices guiding the management and processing of loans."</data>
