  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clear to Close Status indicates that a loan has been approved and is ready for funding and closing procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Clear to Close Status indicates that all necessary documents and conditions for a mortgage loan have been satisfied, and the loan is ready for funding."</data>
