<node id="&quot;HPML&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HPML stands for Higher Priced Mortgage Loans, which are consumer loans secured by a principal dwelling with specified interest rate thresholds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 19}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER-PURPOSE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consumer-purpose Loans are loans intended for individual consumers rather than businesses, often used for personal expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBORDINATE-LIEN LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subordinate-lien Loans are secondary loans secured against a property, which have lower priority compared to primary loans in the event of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER CREDITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Credits refer to funds provided by a lender to cover closing costs, often used to assist borrowers in financing the cost of their loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 20}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE PRODUCTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligible Products are loans or mortgage options that meet criteria to qualify as Higher Priced Mortgage Loans (HPML)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTABLE RATE MORTGAGE (ARM)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustable Rate Mortgage (ARM) is a type of mortgage where the interest rate may change periodically based on changes in a corresponding financial index."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
