<node id="&quot;REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refinance is the process of replacing an existing loan with a new loan, typically with better rates or terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
