<node id="&quot;PRE-PAYMENT PENALTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pre-payment Penalty refers to a fee charged to a borrower for paying off a loan before its term ends."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
