  <data key="d1">"Higher Priced Mortgage Loan is a specific classification of mortgage that is subject to additional regulations due to its higher interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Higher Priced Mortgage Loan refers to a classification in mortgage lending that indicates a loan with higher interest rates, often requiring special regulations."</data>
