  <data key="d2">chunk-6baa5293c454b23773beb478dc4d7a71</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 21}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage is a type of loan specifically used to purchase real estate, where the property serves as collateral."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6baa5293c454b23773beb478dc4d7a71</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 23}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA INTEREST RATE REDUCTION REFINANCE LOAN (IRRRL)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Interest Rate Reduction Refinance Loan (IRRRL) is a VA-guaranteed loan designed for refinancing existing VA loans, typically at a lower interest rate, offering reduced principal and interest payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIXED-RATE MORTGAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fixed-Rate Mortgages are loan products offered under the IRRRL program that include various term lengths such as 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTABLE-RATE MORTGAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustable-Rate Mortgages are loan products that combine traditional and jumbo loan amounts, providing options like 5/1 CMT, but exclude manufactured homes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HUD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HUD is the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development, responsible for overseeing and managing the Credit Alert Interactive Voice Response System (CAIVRS) used in the IRRRL process."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD, the U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development, oversees various housing-related programs, including the IRRRL process and manages the Credit Alert Interactive Voice Response System (CAIVRS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) is a government agency that oversees housing-related programs and initiatives, including the management of the IRRRL process and CAIVRS."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 18}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flagstar Bank is a financial institution that offers a variety of loan services, with a focus on manufactured home loans and refinancing programs, particularly under initiatives like the VA IRRRL program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is a financial institution that provides a range of loan services, including the management of manufactured home loans and refinancing programs, particularly under the VA IRRRL program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is a financial institution that services certain manufactured home loans under the VA IRRRL program, specifically for refinances of VA loans that it has serviced."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is a financial institution that services loans under the VA Interest Rate Reduction Refinance Loan (IRRRL) program, offering refinancing options specifically for VA loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 19}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA PAMPHLET 26-7&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"VA Pamphlet 26-7 provides guidelines and regulations relevant to VA loans, including the IRRRL program and borrower eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA FUNDING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Funding Fee is a fee collected by the VA on each loan to cover potential losses and defaults, currently set at 0.5% for IRRRL loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT ALERT INTERACTIVE VOICE RESPONSE SYSTEM (CAIVRS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CAIVRS is a system used for screening borrowers to check for loans that are delinquent or in default, critical for the IRRRL process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPUTATION WORKSHEET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Computation Worksheet is a document required for submitting applications for the IRRRL, detailing necessary information for processing the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY BUYDOWNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary Buydowns refer to a financing arrangement in which the interest rate is reduced for an initial period, but are not eligible under the IRRRL program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Temporary Buydowns refer to a situation where the borrower pays a reduced rate of interest for a temporary period, but in the context of this document, these are not eligible under the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBILITY GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligibility Guidelines provide specific criteria regarding which types of properties, borrowers, and loan amounts are eligible for the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 15}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA REGIONAL OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Regional Office is the location where certain IRRRL loans, particularly those over 30 days past due, must be processed and closed with prior approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 15}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDOMINIUMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Condominiums are types of eligible properties specified in the VA IRRRL guidelines that can be financed under the program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Planned Unit Developments (PUDs) are also listed as eligible property types for financing under the VA IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURED HOMES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Manufactured Homes refer to homes that may be financed under the IRRRL program, though specific restrictions apply regarding eligibility, primarily for fixed-rate products only."</data>
