</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE WIDE MANUFACTURED HOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Wide Manufactured Homes are specified as ineligible for financing under the VA IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COOPERATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cooperatives are noted as ineligible property types under the VA IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKING FARM, RANCH OR ORCHARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Working Farms, Ranches, or Orchards are identified as ineligible properties for the VA IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA LENDER'S HANDBOOK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Lender's Handbook contains essential guidelines and instructions for VA loans, including underwriting requirements for the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
