</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN AMOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Amounts refer to the total financing amount that can be approved under the IRRRL program, not exceeding specific limits set by the VA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
