</node>
<node id="&quot;VA PAMPHLET 26-7 CHAPTER 8&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chapter 8 of VA Pamphlet 26-7 outlines the allowable fees and closing costs that can be charged to borrowers in VA loans, relevant for the IRRRL program."</data>
