</node>
<node id="&quot;VA AGENT IDENTIFICATION NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A VA Agent Identification Number is a unique identifier for lenders approved by the VA to facilitate access to necessary VA tools and resources."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
