  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Resource for Borrowers refers to the VA website and associated documents that provide eligibility and application information for the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA FUNDING FEE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Funding Fee Rate is the percentage fee applied to VA loans, determined by various factors including the type of loan and borrower status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING VA LOAN BALANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Existing VA Loan Balance refers to the total amount due on an active VA loan that can be refinanced through the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL AND INTEREST PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Principal and Interest Payments are the components of loan payments that go towards the loan balance and the interest accrued, central to the structure of VA loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBILITY GUIDELINES DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Eligibility Guidelines Document contains detailed information on which types of properties and borrowers qualify for the IRRRL program."</data>
