</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERWRITING REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Requirements refer to the standards and criteria that lenders must follow when assessing loan applications for the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 15}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PROCESSING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Processing Guidelines provide instructions on how to properly process loans under the IRRRL program, including necessary documentation and steps."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 15}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN LIMITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Limits define the maximum amounts allowed for VA loans, which vary based on the number of units and other factors, impacting IRRRL eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMANENT FOUNDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Permanent Foundation is a requirement for certain types of properties, including manufactured homes, to be eligible for financing under the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCURATE CREDIT SCORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Accurate Credit Score is crucial for loan qualification under the IRRRL program, reflecting a borrower's creditworthiness and repayment ability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECT TO VA REGIONAL OFFICE PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Direct to VA Regional Office Processing refers to the requirement that certain IRRRL loans, such as those over 30 days past due, must be submitted directly to a regional VA office for approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
