</node>
<node id="&quot;IRRRL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRRRL (Interest Rate Reduction Refinancing Loan) refers to a type of loan with a funding fee of 0.5% and specific adjustable rate details."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 10}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;5/1 ARM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"5/1 ARM is an adjustable rate mortgage product where the interest rate is fixed for the first five years and adjusts thereafter according to specified caps and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 10}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flagstar is a financial institution providing loan services including the ordering of closing documentation through its web-based platform."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUERTO RICO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Puerto Rico is a location mentioned in the context of state eligibility, indicating it is not eligible for certain loan products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
