<node id="&quot;ADJUSTMENT CAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustment Caps refer to the limits on how much the interest rate can increase or decrease during specific adjustment periods for adjustable-rate mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
