</node>
<node id="&quot;MARGIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Margin is the additional amount added to the index value to determine the interest rate for adjustable-rate loans, noted in the price indication sheet."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 10}]</data>
