<node id="&quot;INITIAL INTEREST RATE CHANGE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Initial Interest Rate Change Date is the date when the first change in the interest rate occurs for the 5/1 ARM loan product after the initial fixed period."</data>
